§ `s 2, s 5 and First Schedule`

#ASSERT `is a social residential home` `a disability home admitting at 17`
#ASSERT NOT `is a social residential home` `a rooming house`

#ASSERT `is an adult disability home` `a disability home`
#ASSERT NOT `is an adult disability home` `a disability home admitting at 17`
#ASSERT `is an adult disability home` `an elderly disabled resident's home`

#ASSERT `is a sheltered home` `a sheltered home`
#ASSERT NOT `is a sheltered home` `an elderly disabled resident's home`

#ASSERT `is a home for children and young persons` `a children's home`
#ASSERT `is a home for children and young persons` `a youth home for a 20-year-old`
#ASSERT NOT `is a home for children and young persons` `a youth home for a 21-year-old`
#ASSERT NOT `is a home for children and young persons` `a boarding school`

#ASSERT `is a licensable SRH` `a welfare home`
#ASSERT NOT `is a licensable SRH` `a nursing home`

#ASSERT `the Act's licensing applies` `a sheltered home`
#ASSERT NOT `the Act's licensing applies` `a government sheltered home`

§ `s 6`

#ASSERT `operating without authority is an offence` `a disability home` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `operating without authority is an offence` `a disability home` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `operating without authority is an offence` `a disability home` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `operating without authority is an offence` `a government sheltered home` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `operating without authority is an offence` `a youth home for a 21-year-old` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE

#ASSERT `the maximum fine for unlicensed operation` `no previous conviction` EQUALS 100000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine for unlicensed operation` `section 4(1) of the Homes for the Aged Act` EQUALS 200000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine for unlicensed operation` `an unrelated offence` EQUALS 100000

§ `ss 17-19`

#ASSERT `the maximum fine for unapproved staff` 10 EQUALS 60000

§ `s 36(6)`

#ASSERT NOT `keeping out a Board of Visitors is an offence` FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `keeping out a Board of Visitors is an offence` FALSE TRUE TRUE

§ `s 37`

#ASSERT `the use of force or restraint is permitted` `a trained carer stopping self-harm`
#ASSERT NOT `the use of force or restraint is permitted` `an untrained carer stopping self-harm`
#ASSERT NOT `the use of force or restraint is permitted` `restraint as punishment`
#ASSERT NOT `the use of force or restraint is permitted` `stopping absconding from an unprescribed home`
#ASSERT `the use of force or restraint is permitted` `stopping absconding from a prescribed home`
#ASSERT NOT `the use of force or restraint is permitted` `excessive force`

§ `s 38`

#ASSERT `the publication contravenes section 38(1)` `a stranger's post naming a resident`
#ASSERT NOT `the publication contravenes section 38(1)` `an approved news report`
#ASSERT NOT `the publication contravenes section 38(1)` `a former resident's own post`
#ASSERT NOT `the publication contravenes section 38(1)` `a post with an adult resident's consent`
